# Author: Athul Prem | _AP_pnc
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Credit Athul Prem and the exact repository revision when using this research project. The _AP_pnc tag identifies project artifacts."
title: "Phononic Nanobeam Design Lab (_AP_pnc)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Prem
    given-names: Athul
    affiliation: University of South Dakota
    email: athul.prem@coyotes.usd.edu
repository-code: "https://github.com/premathul/Phononic-Nanobeam-Design-Lab"
abstract: "Configurable three-dimensional finite-element simulation of germanium nanobeams, with a desktop workbench, power-normalized matched-port scattering and reproducible finite responses for the straight 26-hole device. Full-device spatial and frequency convergence remain unresolved. Historical two-dimensional evidence and the proposed research campaign are documented separately."
